<title>USA: Haddon Heights BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Haddon Heights BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $2.333 million of Haddon Heights Board of Education, N.J., school bonds, Series 1997, with a rate of 5.20 percent and a price of 100.098.</p>
</text>
